name: The Pillar — previously played debuff
author: corpus
description: >-
  The Pillar debuffs cards played previously in this Ante. Ante 1 boss: use tarot to modify
  debuffed cards or play fresh cards each hand.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - boss: ThePillar
    antes: [1]
should:
  - joker: Luchador
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Chicot
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - tarotCard: TheStar
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
